== Trivia ==
* In his [https://youtu.be/kby0rXT7qYQ first post-Repentance Lore Stream], Edmund McMillen revealed that The Belt is inspired by a real belt that his step-father would crack menacingly to threaten him with.
** The Belt granting a speed up is a nod to the act of running faster out of fear of being hit.
** In this way, The Belt is a counterpart to {{I|Wooden Spoon}}, which is also a speed-up item based on a specific object used by McMillen's parents to abuse him.

